          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "జనగణన — janagaṇana — \"a census\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పది సంవత్సరాలకు ఒకసారి జనగణన జరుగుతుంది. padi saṁvatsarālaku okasāri janagaṇana jarugutundi. A census takes place once every ten years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "జన, people, + గణన, counting."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "జనగణన (janagaṇana) is built from Sanskrit jana, \"a person, people\" (CDIAL 5098), and gaṇana, \"counting\" (CDIAL 3992)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
